<title>USA: FelCor Suite Hotels buys hotel for $48.5 mln.</title>
<headline>FelCor Suite Hotels buys hotel for $48.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>FelCor Suite Hotels Inc said Thursday it had purchased a 317-suite hotel in Atlanta for $48.5 million in cash.</p>
<p>The hotel is an Embassy Suites in the Buckhead area of Atlanta. The company said it expects to spend about $1.7 million on the property in 1997.</p>
<p>Promus Hotel Corp will continue to manage the hotel under the Embassy Suites brand.</p>
</text>
